      ],
      "text": "3.1.2 Implementation considerations for all tools",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        569.5849609375,
        527.34521484375,
        584.0279541015625
      ],
      "text": "The GDG considered that all three approaches – symptom screening, CXR and mWRD – may have",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        582.7850341796875,
        527.3682861328125,
        597.22802734375
      ],
      "text": "roles in screening for TB disease in the general population. The ranking of the tools according to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        595.9849853515625,
        527.4067993164062,
        610.427978515625
      ],
      "text": "accuracy proposed by the GDG is: first, CXR; second, mWRDs; third, screening for any TB symptom",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        609.1849975585938,
        527.3355102539062,
        623.6279907226562
      ],
      "text": "(higher sensitivity and lower specificity); and fourth, screening for any cough or cough lasting 2 weeks",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        622.385009765625,
        527.4120483398438,
        636.8280029296875
      ],
      "text": "or longer (lower sensitivity and higher specificity). However, ease of implementation is highest by far for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.973467826843262,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        635.5850219726562,
        527.4453125,
        650.0280151367188
      ],
      "text": "symptom screening, and less so for CXR and mWRDs with the requirement of additional equipment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        648.7850341796875,
        527.4432373046875,
        663.22802734375
      ],
      "text": "and resources. The GDG noted that factors related to patient selection, flow and timing may affect",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        661.9849853515625,
        527.4714965820312,
        676.427978515625
      ],
      "text": "the measures of accuracy observed for CXR to detect TB. The inferences made about using mWRDs",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        675.1849975585938,
        527.4450073242188,
        689.6279907226562
      ],
      "text": "for screening in the general population relate primarily to pooled studies in high-risk populations and,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.993098258972168,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        688.385009765625,
        527.5879516601562,
        702.8280029296875
      ],
      "text": "therefore, there is uncertainty about whether the findings are directly applicable to a general population",
